    plain: 'Every card in the readmissions room now opens a case page. It reads, top to bottom: the card header · why this case was flagged (assembled by code from the detection facts — no model) · the agent\'s account — an intern-style presentation of the case written ONCE, at audit time, by Claude Opus 4.6 on AWS Bedrock, in which every factual sentence carries a citation to the evidence ledger, and the account is shown only when code has checked that every citation resolves; an account with even one invented citation is stored for review but never shown · the evidence ledger — every item the audit read, with its source, which stay it belongs to, whether it is the treating team\'s own words or a disinterested record, and its date · prior findings related to this return — the patient\'s earlier low-value-care flags from CDMSS\'s own OPD audits, joined through the hospital record and filtered by the model to those with a stated clinical thread to this return (both ends of each link checked by code), always headed by the honest denominator "N of this patient\'s M OPD notes have been audited" because most notes have not been, and absence of flags is never clean care · both hospital bills · the download button. Nothing on the page calls a model or writes anything; it renders what was stored. The ~135-case backlog gets its accounts through the existing Bedrock backfill rails as a new run type an operator starts deliberately (never on deploy), paced at two findings per tick; new audits get theirs inline (measured 22–25 s per account). No judgement, badge, engine version, prompt or note score changes.',
    title: 'Readmissions R4 — the case page: stored audit-time narrative (Opus 4.6 on Bedrock) with code-enforced citations, the evidence ledger, related prior LVC findings with the denominator rule, cards clickable, readmission-narrative run type on the Bedrock backfill rails (CDMSS-READMISSIONS-R4-PRD v1.0; V ruled R4-1..R4-11 incl. R4-8 / R4-11 on 18 Aug 2026; evidence CDMSS-TWIN-PRESTUDY-OPD-READMIT-18-AUG-2026). New pure lib/readmission-narrative-core.ts (citation validator, relatedLvc reducer, three-hop join helpers, ledger); buildNarrativePrompt + parseNarrativeOutput appended to lib/readmission-prompts.ts (recon builders byte-identical, pinned by fingerprint); lib/readmission/narrative.ts (the leg), lib/readmission/opd-lvc.ts (app-DB hop 1), db13 fetchPriorPrescriptionDocs (hop 2), store saveCaseArtefacts + narrative readers (blob-only, no DDL); run.ts inline leg after saveAuditResult (default on, READMIT_NARRATIVE_INLINE=0 opts out); worker \'readmission\' on backfill-runs-core (Bedrock-only) + lib/readmission/narrative-backfill.ts + /api/admin/readmission-narrative-backfill, ticked by the idle OPD backfill cron; case route additive (whyFlagged / evidenceLedger / caseNarrative / narrativeState / relatedLvc); new page /care/readmissions/case/[key] + ReadmissionCasePage; board cards clickable. READMIT_ENGINE_VERSION readmission/0.2 stands.',
