      'NO MODEL AT PAGE TIME (R4-2): the case route and page render stored artefacts only; a source-read test pins that neither imports a model call. The narrative, ledger and relatedLvc are written once (audit path or backfill tick) onto the finding jsonb — blob-only, no column, no migration, no engine bump (the R1 judgement-column reasoning); pre-R4 rows read "no account written for this case yet".',
