    why: 'V\'s R3 ruling on 18 Aug once the bill was measured reachable and trustworthy: one defensible cost per return stay belongs on the card, computed from the hospital\'s own line items and shown as computed. The three non-figure states exist because "not billed yet", "could not ask" and "no Even bill can exist" are three different facts, and because ₹0 for any of them would be a lie a care manager would quote.',
