    why: 'V\'s ratification of the R2 PRD on 17 Aug: the notes the recon was blind to were already in the database, scraped and final; wiring them is a catalog change, not a product. The five states exist because "we did not look", "we looked and found nothing", "we looked and found a blank form" and "the fetch broke" are four different facts a care manager must be able to tell apart — and because a missing OT note must never read as a clean operation.',
