    title: 'Readmissions R1 — case-card list + downloadable case brief + two stored advisory judgements (CDMSS-READMISSIONS-R1-PRD v1.1, 17 Aug 2026; nine critique patches ratified by V). Engine: deriveJudgements + JUDGEMENT_RULE_VERSION = readmit-judgement/1 in lib/readmission-reconcile-core.ts (pure; §4 rules verbatim). Store: preventable_injury / negligence / judgement_rule_version columns written by saveAuditResult, read by listFindingsForSurface and the new pinned single-row reader fetchFindingForSurface; migrate-readmissions adds the three columns (ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS) and runs a versioned, idempotent ≤200-row backfill per request. Join: fetchExtractedCases batch reader (empty map on fault) + list-route `indexCase` per row (additive). New GET /api/care/readmissions/case?dedup_key= pinned to READMIT_ENGINE_VERSION (unknown → 404). New lib/readmission/brief.ts composer (golden-file test) and lib/readmission/surface-row.ts (the one row→SurfaceFinding mapping, shared by both routes). Board: lanes.flatMap → review-first sort, counts line, held-out toggle, the §3 card, download via the escalate-button Blob pattern. Readmission engine NOT bumped (readmission/0.1); the OPD engine is untouched.',
