    why: 'V asked why the midnight Gemini spike had all but vanished (30 Jul, 05:30 IST). It had not vanished — it had been running at the wrong hour since the cron was written, and was separately starved by the determinism pin. This entry closes the scheduling half; the throughput half is a live decision about how much determinism to trade back.',
