      'ENGINE HALF — applySuppressions gains the skip applyDemotes already had: `if (isSafetySignalType(f.signal_type)) { kept.push(f); continue; }`, placed before the rule match. applySuppressions never sees demote rules (the store excludes them from loadActiveSuppressions), so this covers precisely the drop/downgrade gap and nothing else.',
